            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-0-text",
              "text": "In the LinkedIn Developer Portal create an app associated with a LinkedIn Page you administer, then on the Products tab add the self-serve products Sign In with LinkedIn using OpenID Connect and Share on LinkedIn. Register the redirect URI https://graphx.ragentic.io/registry/oauth/callback in the app's Auth tab (Authorized redirect URLs). Your Ragentic operator installs the app's client ID (and secret) in Ragentic's OAuth registrations file; they never go in this form or in the catalog. Posting as an organization (Community Management API) needs LinkedIn's product approval and is not part of this connection."
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-0-link-0-label",
              "text": "LinkedIn Developer Portal"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/developers/apps"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-0-link-0-label",
              "component": "Button",
              "id": "step-0-link-0"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-0-link-1-label",
              "text": "Share on LinkedIn"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/consumer/integrations/self-serve/share-on-linkedin"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-0-link-1-label",
              "component": "Button",
              "id": "step-0-link-1"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                "step-1-text",
                "step-1-link-0"
              ],
              "component": "Column",
              "id": "step-1"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-1-text",
              "text": "Connect opens LinkedIn to authorize openid, profile, email and w_member_social. Ragentic can then read your sign-in profile and create or delete posts as you. Self-serve tokens last 60 days and LinkedIn does not issue refresh tokens to self-serve apps, so reconnect when it expires."
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-1-link-0-label",
              "text": "Authorization code flow"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/shared/authentication/authorization-code-flow"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-1-link-0-label",
              "component": "Button",
              "id": "step-1-link-0"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                "step-2-text",
                "step-2-link-0"
              ],
              "component": "Column",
              "id": "step-2"
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-2-text",
              "text": "After you approve, Ragentic reads GET /v2/userinfo to confirm the member (it posts nothing), then saves the encrypted token. Requests send LinkedIn-Version 202610; daily rate limits are shown on your app's Analytics tab."
            },
            {
              "component": "Text",
              "id": "step-2-link-0-label",
              "text": "Sign In with LinkedIn using OpenID Connect"
            },
            {
              "action": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "openUrl",
                  "args": {
                    "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/consumer/integrations/self-serve/sign-in-with-linkedin-v2"
                  }
                }
              },
              "child": "step-2-link-0-label",
